      "content": "\"let go of the burden\" ... i don't know. it feels like the only way to actually let go of it is to just not be there. like, if i wasn't around, the house would still run, the kids would be fine with their dad or whoever, and the cycle would just... end. it's the only way i can imagine actually finding peace. it's the only way to stop feeling so heavy.",
